                { "key": "filter[decision]", "value": "Accepted",     "disabled": true },
                { "key": "filter[name]",     "value": "Ahmed",        "disabled": true },
                { "key": "sort",             "value": "-created_at",  "disabled": true }
              ]
            },
            "description": "**Filters:** `filter[status]`, `filter[decision]`, `filter[name]` (candidate name)\n**Sorts:** `sort=created_at`, `sort=-decision_date`\n\n**Status values:** `Under Review` | `Scheduled` | `Shortlisted` | `Accepted` | `Rejected`"
          }
        },
